<title>NETHERLANDS: HOEK LOOS H1 NET PROFIT 28.9 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>HOEK LOOS H1 NET PROFIT 28.9 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.38 vs   3.70</p>
<p>    Net profit			    28.9  vs  24.5</p>
<p>    Turnover			     273.6  vs 290.3 </p>
<p>    Operating profit		    44.4  vs  40.7 </p>
<p>Note - Industrial gases maker Hoek Loos NV.</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     2.20 vs   5.05</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.26 vs  11.16</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
